{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/description_1.png?t=1746066844\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you like logic-puzzles? <i>Of course you do</i>, what a silly question! Piczle World of Puzzles brings together all your favourite Piczle puzzles in one addictive package!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From classic nonograms to colour logic-puzzles, from challenging brain-scratchers to relaxing mind-calmers, Piczle World of Puzzles is packed <i>to the hilt</i> with picture-based logic-puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/extras/pwop_animgif_1.gif?t=1746066844\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All the features!</strong><br>Each puzzle type has an extensive set of play options to cater the experience to your exact liking. Time your progress, or not. Check for mistakes or play hardcore. Start with a hint or go in blind. The <i>only</i> wrong way to play is to not play at all! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play the puzzles you want!</strong><br>Free-to-start, Piczle World of Puzzles lets you sample each puzzle type. Through DLC you can get many more puzzles of your favourite type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Create your own!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your own puzzles with a powerful editor and share them with the Steam community!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2174300?t=1746066844","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2174300?t=1746066844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174300/e5653711a9b0ff14e3972a57c7595e8ea38d5cdf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746066844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset